\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs22\b PuzzleDesk\b0\par
\par
PuzzleDesk is a remote desktop application by PuzzleNet (PuzzleNet Technical Group). It is built on free and open-source software and is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (AGPL-3.0). The full licence text is included with this application.\par
\par
\b Privacy\b0\par
PuzzleDesk connects only to the PuzzleNet remote server configured for this application. Your device ID and the screen, keyboard and file data you share during a remote session are used only to establish and maintain the connection you request. PuzzleNet does not sell or share your personal data with third parties.\par
\par
For support and more information, visit https://puzzlenetdesk.ir\par
